  translation {
    text: "Level 1 of the Englewood Park-n-Ride garage is currently closed. RTD customers may continue to park on the ramp and 2nd floor using the South entrance/exit only. Additional RTD parking is available in the surface lot north of the Englewood Civic Center. Bus operations are not affected."
